# p06 not applicable: class-level statement versus per-record code
#
# LinkML option: option3 sibling, via a value_presence: ABSENT rule (docs/crosswalk.md, cause a)
# for the class-level form; the per-record GENEPIO form is what options 1, 1b, 2 and 3 carry.
#
# Class-level: ex:RemoteConsultationEncounter is a health care encounter that has exactly zero
# glucose assays as parts. Every encounter typed this way inherits the absence; nothing is
# written per record. A consumer (or reasoner) can infer that a glucose assay here would be an
# error, and ROBOT shows that asserting one makes the graph inconsistent
# (p06_not_applicable_contradiction.ttl).
#
# Per-record: a datum node is minted only to carry a GENEPIO:0001619 'not applicable' status.
# A consumer can find it by query, but the same fact is repeated once per row, and a datum is
# asserted to exist for a measurement that does not apply.
#
# OWL 2 DL note: 'has part' is declared transitive (checked in the RO axioms shipped in OBI
# 2026-07-27), which makes it a non-simple property, and
# OWL 2 DL forbids cardinality restrictions on non-simple properties. base.ttl does not copy the
# transitivity axiom, so this file stays in DL. Merged with RO, write the same restriction as
# the equivalent "not (has part some glucose assay)", which is the p10 form.

@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:      <https://example.org/encounter/> .
@prefix BFO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_> .
@prefix RO:      <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_> .
@prefix IAO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_> .
@prefix OBI:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_> .
@prefix OGMS:    <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_> .
@prefix GENEPIO: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_> .

### Class-level form

ex:RemoteConsultationEncounter a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "remote consultation encounter" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf OGMS:0000097 ,
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
          owl:onProperty BFO:0000051 ;
          owl:qualifiedCardinality "0"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
          owl:onClass OBI:2100020 ] .

ex:encounter2 a owl:NamedIndividual , ex:RemoteConsultationEncounter ;
    rdfs:label "encounter 2 (remote)" ;
    RO:0000057 ex:patient1 , ex:provider1 .

### Per-record form, for contrast

ex:glucoseDatum2 a owl:NamedIndividual , IAO:0000109 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:patient1 .

ex:status6 a owl:NamedIndividual , GENEPIO:0001619 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:glucoseDatum2 .
